  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to make sure that the OCFL and files therein created by migration-utils aligns with the Fedora 6 expectations. Those expectations are currently documented here:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LVPeGwfhnqttcRs-KV_ZQSzRrtBEOiTHd1ZhJ5MtWxc/edit?usp=sharing"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LVPeGwfhnqttcRs-KV_ZQSzRrtBEOiTHd1ZhJ5MtWxc/edit?usp=sharing",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In addition, the migration-utils should provide a switch optionally exporting to OCFL without Fedora 6 metadata.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
