  "description": "<p>This task is to make sure that the OCFL and files therein created by migration-utils aligns with the Fedora 6 expectations. Those expectations are currently documented here:<br/>\n <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LVPeGwfhnqttcRs-KV_ZQSzRrtBEOiTHd1ZhJ5MtWxc/edit?usp=sharing\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LVPeGwfhnqttcRs-KV_ZQSzRrtBEOiTHd1ZhJ5MtWxc/edit?usp=sharing</a></p>\n\n<p>In addition, the migration-utils should provide a switch optionally exporting to OCFL without Fedora 6 metadata.</p>",
